  Prompt caching can only reuse a literal shared PREFIX, so everything that is identical
  across every unit of a case is hoisted ABOVE the first byte that varies:

      INVARIANT (the cacheable prefix)   intro, Case, framework surface, devices, fill rules
      VARIES PER UNIT (below the line)   the unit, its blank block, its fragments, its CLI
                                         reference, output format

