  DO NOT reintroduce a positional word there: it is included by BOTH this template and
  pt_generate_script.jinja, which place the reference on opposite sides of the rules.
  Measured cost of getting this wrong: putting the CLI reference above the rules halves the
  shared prefix, 11,143 -> 5,663 chars.

  Before the reorder the fill rules sat LAST and the 30 unit prompts of a case shared a
  343-character prefix — 0.7%. tests/test_pt_per_unit.py pins the ordering; run it after
